            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "OpenAI releases GPT-5.5 Instant as new default ChatGPT model, targeting law, medicine, and finance",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "OpenAI has released GPT-5.5 Instant as the new default model for ChatGPT, replacing its predecessor across the platform. The company says the model reduces hallucinations in high-stakes domains including law, medicine, and finance while preserving the low-latency speed users expect. The update affects all ChatGPT users by default, making it one of the most broadly impactful model rollouts OpenAI has executed.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/05/openai-releases-gpt-5-5-instant-a-new-default-model-for-chatgpt/",
